<SCRIPT LANGUAGE="JavaScript">

<!--//

   if (document.images) {

      // Load images needed [BACK] button.

      back_on  = new Image(); back_on.src  = "../../buttons/back_on.gif";  
      back_off = new Image(); back_off.src = "../../buttons/back.gif";  
   }

   function TurnOn() {

      // Displays image and updates status bar.

      if (document.images) {
         document["back"].src = back_on.src;
         window.status = 'Go back to previous page';
      }
   }

   function TurnOff() {

      // Displays image and clears status bar.

      if (document.images) {
         document["back"].src = back_off.src;
         window.status = '';
      }
   }

//-->

</SCRIPT>

<H3><CENTER><FONT COLOR="#ffff00"><A HREF="mailto:ben.sleeman@lineone.net">Ben Sleeman</A></FONT></CENTER></H3>

        Ben has a J plate 5 door 2.0ie 16v Tipo. Ben paid &pound2400 for his
        64,000 mile car.
        Ben has replaced his catalytic converter with a 2 inch stainless steel straight
        through pipe. See Ben's car in action in the
        <A HREF="../multimedia/multimedia.html">multimedia</A> section. Ben recently took
	his Tipo to &quot;Power Engineering&quot; for a dyno run and it produced
	an excellent 158 bhp.
	<P>
	In December 2000 Ben replaced his back box with a Supersprint costing &pound;215.
	<P> 
	Ben has now lowered the car using eibach springs and fitted some Fiat
	Coupe 4 spoke 16&quot; alloys. 


